      en: ["The lake covers a maximum surface area of 9.5 square kilometers.", "It is part of Moldova's first UNESCO Biosphere Reserve, established in 2018.", "More than 190 bird species have been documented in the lake area.", "The average depth of the lake ranges from only 0.5 to 2 meters.", "Two-thirds of the water surface is covered by permanent aquatic vegetation.", "The lake is considered a remnant of the ancient Paratethys Sea."],
