      en: ["The reserve covers a total area of 916 hectares.", "Rudi Monastery was constructed in 1777 in the traditional Moldovan style.", "The Cave of the Dead is about 75 meters long and was partially man-made.", "The Struve Geodetic Arc point at Rudi is a UNESCO World Heritage site.", "The area features several waterfalls cascading over limestone ledges.", "The remains of ancient Getic fortresses are located near the reserve."],
