      en: ["The national park was legally established on March 31, 2022.", "The total area covers precisely 61,884.5 hectares.", "It incorporates the Ramsar wetland site of international importance No. 1316.", "More than 80 species of fish inhabit the river and its branches here.", "Approximately 230 bird species have been documented within the park.", "The park's territory includes lands from 13 different rural communities."],
